{"id":"stabil","lemma":"stabil","pos":"adj","rank":2829,"glosses":["stable","dope, rad, fly"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/a/a0/De-stabil.ogg/De-stabil.ogg.mp3","forms":{"comparative":"stabiler","superlative":"am stabilsten"},"examples":[{"text":"Der Zustand des Patienten ist stabil.","en":"The patient's condition is stable.","words":[{"g":"the"},{"g":"condition"},{"g":"of the","l":"der"},{"g":"patient","l":"Patient"},{"g":"is","l":"sein"},null]},{"text":"Das Bett sieht stabil aus.","en":"The bed looks sturdy.","words":[{"g":"the / that"},{"g":"bed (piece of furniture"},{"g":"to see","l":"sehen"},null,{"g":"out of / from"}]},{"text":"Dieses Bett scheint stabil zu sein.","en":"This bed seems sturdy.","words":[{"g":"this one, this","l":"dieser"},{"g":"bed (piece of furniture"},{"g":"to shine","l":"scheinen"},null,{"g":"to / too"},{"g":"to be"}]},{"text":"Nimm diesen Stuhl — der ist stabil!","en":"Take this chair. It's sturdy.","words":[{"g":"to take","l":"nehmen"},{"g":"this one, this","l":"dieser"},{"g":"a chair"},{"g":"the"},{"g":"is","l":"sein"},null]},{"text":"Die Scheune war klein, aber stabil.","en":"The barn was small, but it was strong.","words":[{"g":"the"},{"g":"barn"},{"g":"was","l":"sein"},{"g":"small, little, wee"},{"g":"but"},null]}]}